    "measurementTechnique": [
      "In July of 2018, UAS platforms were used to collect LiDAR data and RGB imagery at the Teller mile marker 27 field site on the Seward Peninsula, Alaska. LiDAR files (*.lpd) in this data package are raw and have not been processed or corrected. Associated base station files are included in the form of *.rinex and *.rtcm3 files. RGB imagery (*.jpg files) in this package are also unprocessed."
